 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "s is the board; s[i] is \"X\" (an obstacle) or a concatenation of directives, each \"L\" or \"R\" optionally followed by a positive decimal step without leading zeros (default 1). From cell i a directive Lk moves to i - k and Rk to i + k; a move is allowed only when it lands inside the board on a non-obstacle cell. Starting from cell start, return the minimum number of moves needed to land on the last cell n - 1, 0 when start is n - 1, or -1 when the last cell cannot be reached or start is an obstacle.",
